WEBVTT

00:08:29.871 --> 00:08:35.829
either judge ourselves for having
so-called bad emotions like sadness,

00:08:36.579 --> 00:08:38.621
anger or even grief.

00:08:40.454 --> 00:08:44.204
Or actively try to push
aside these feelings.

00:08:45.704 --> 00:08:48.662
We do this not only to ourselves,
but also to people we love,

00:08:48.662 --> 00:08:52.496
like our children, we may inadvertently
shame them out of emotion,

00:08:52.537 --> 00:08:55.454
seen as negative, jumped jump to solution

00:08:56.246 --> 00:09:00.954
and fail to help them to see these
emotions as inherently valuable.